    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42783" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρῡκᾰνάω</span></b> , poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύκω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>restrain, withhold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖνον ἐρυκανόωσ᾽ ἀέκοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.199
				</span></i>
			 : c.inf., <i>from</i> doing, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.205
			</span></i> : also 
				Ep.
			
			impf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύκανε</span> (from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρῡκάνω</span></b> ) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.429
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				647
			</span></i>.</div>
